SUMMARY:FRONT BAR: BYO Vinyl w/Soccer Moses
DESCRIPTION:East Nashville’s own Stephen Mason (Jars of Clay\, The Handsomizer\, dad jokester extraordinaire) hosts BYO Vinyl in the front bar. Possible appearance by Soccer Moses (Nashville Scene’s #1 religious leader 2021\, 2023) Bring your favorite record and see if it summons him!\nBONUS: extended HAPPY HOUR til 8pm!!!
