SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Paul Loren
DESCRIPTION:CHOOSE FROM PAUL’S SONG LIST\nMAKE A REQUEST!\nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @PaulLoren \nSinger-songwriter and ‘piano man’ Paul Loren grew up hooked on the classic sounds of New York oldies radio\, and it shows! With his throwback voice\, playing\, tailored sense of style and twinkle-in-his-eye personality\, Paul has won over fans and devotees from coast to coast. A Nashville newbie\, Paul has imported some timeless East Coast charm along with a wide repertoire of songs into the fabric of Music City. IG: @paullorenmusic
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-w-paul-loren-4/2026-05-13/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
