SUMMARY:Bummer Night w/Kira
DESCRIPTION:Now with an EXTRA HOUR of sad bangers!! \nWe call it “group theraoke” and sort songs into a growing list of “sadegories” for no reason other than it entertains us.  Join Kira Small for a karaoke/singalong/cry in your beer/toast the past/catharsis/whatever night. Bring your most indulgent tearjerking requests (karaoke or otherwise) and we will lean in and get our feels on. Like Truvy said\, “Laughter through tears is my favorite emotion!” \nCHOOSE A SONG FROM KIRA’S SONG LIST  (*bummer night tab)\nMAKE A REQUEST!\nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @kira-small   Paypal: @kirasmall  CashApp: $kirasmallmusic
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/bummer-night-w-kira/2026-05-14/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nashville Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Bummer-Night-Truvy-Clairee-poster.png
END:VEVENT
