SUMMARY:Blue Note Burlesque
DESCRIPTION:Start your weekend early with Blue Note Burlesque\, a night of vintage tease and thrilling variety acts that’ll leave you exclaiming “I can’t believe I found this in an alley!”\n\n\nJoin Ringling Bros. and Barnum & Bailey alum Jim Dandy\, award-winning burlesque performer Delilah Dentata\, and guest artists Lotte Von Bismarck\, Jungle Julia\, and Sage for a night of performances that are a little off-key in all the best ways.\n\n\nWe invite you to stick around after the show – Sid Gold’s piano karaoke begins right where we leave off. Start your evening with our sensationally skilled performers\, end it by attempting a piano-backed rendition of the least karaoke-coded song you know!\n\nMay 14\nTickets Here!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/blue-note-burlesque-6/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/5.14.26.BlueNote.jpg
END:VEVENT
