SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Dan Neustadt
DESCRIPTION:Tip Dan!\nCheck out his song list!\nMake a request!\n\nDan Neustadt (The Hold Steady\, World/Inferno Friendship Society\, Northern Bells) is a keyboardist\, singer-songwriter\, arranger\, and former musical director (also an attorney!). Like Sid Gold’s co-founder Joe McGinty\, Dan is also an alum of the Manhattan Inn and its white baby grand\, where he played stride-piano covers of indie rock singles. Dan’s also the creator of Off The Record\, a NYC and DC concert series featuring “cover-to-cover” instrumentals of seminal rock albums performed by a rotating cast of touring sidemen. Promoted as “Dan Neustadt Plays Your Favorite Albums By Your Favorite Bands\,” a press listing once quipped\, “No\, he’s not kidding.”  Come sing your favorite songs with Dan!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-22-2-2/2026-05-14/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Dan-Neustadt.jpeg
END:VEVENT
